# This repo is PUBLIC and its only job is hosting classmate-facing quiz links.
# Everything else — the dashboard, The System, grades, rituals, working files —
# stays on this computer and is deliberately never pushed.
#
# Ignore everything at the root, then re-allow only what is safe to publish.
#
# The v-* folder is the private build from publish.py. Every page inside it is
# AES-encrypted at build time, so publishing it exposes ciphertext only. The
# folder name is random and the passphrase lives outside the repo.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/share/
!/v-*/
